[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12961.67, "timestamp": "03:36:01", "text": "直播。 那更稳定。 但是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12965.67, "timestamp": "03:36:05", "text": "在崎岖不平的地形上，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12967.99, "timestamp": "03:36:07", "text": "比如森林自行车道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12972.309, "timestamp": "03:36:12", "text": "等等，我们注意到它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12975.67, "timestamp": "03:36:15", "text": "非常颠簸，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12978.95, "timestamp": "03:36:18", "text": "以至于即使我拧紧了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12981.429, "timestamp": "03:36:21", "text": "它，它还是会掉下来。 嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12984.63, "timestamp": "03:36:24", "text": "我想我会努力看看将来我能做些什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12988.229, "timestamp": "03:36:28", "text": "。 目前我暂时就先这样吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12991.99, "timestamp": "03:36:31", "text": "。 嗯，也许以后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12995.75, "timestamp": "03:36:35", "text": "我会买个自行车伞架之类的东西，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13004.309, "timestamp": "03:36:44", "text": "然后用它来固定这个……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13006.79, "timestamp": "03:36:46", "text": "我不知道该怎么做，但如果我没记错的话，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13009.19, "timestamp": "03:36:49", "text": "需要一个夹子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13011.99, "timestamp": "03:36:51", "text": "。"}]